{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a rundown house tucked away in rural Japan, a lone cat awakens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are that cat, exploring empty rooms and dark halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened to the family that once lived in this place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is the eerie figure stalking you from the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fragments of memories to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run. Search. Escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/5a8a061d25752632b2a4a2b77ee8fd26.poster.avif?t=1758008408\" width=650 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/5a8a061d25752632b2a4a2b77ee8fd26.webm?t=1758008408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/5a8a061d25752632b2a4a2b77ee8fd26.mp4?t=1758008408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a Cat in a Haunting Stealth Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak through a family\u2019s old home, gather items, and piece together their memories. A tense stealth exploration game where every creak can betray your presence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/536a2e4a4cb74dba15f88a40a9f986a3.poster.avif?t=1758008408\" width=650 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/536a2e4a4cb74dba15f88a40a9f986a3.webm?t=1758008408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/536a2e4a4cb74dba15f88a40a9f986a3.mp4?t=1758008408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silent Footsteps, Sudden Threats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a noise or panic-run, and something horrifying will stalk you. When the creature locks on, it's time to escape\u2014don\u2019t get caught.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/3e385b0a5413630dd40338b8354e183c.poster.avif?t=1758008408\" width=650 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/3e385b0a5413630dd40338b8354e183c.webm?t=1758008408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/3e385b0a5413630dd40338b8354e183c.mp4?t=1758008408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A True Japanese Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From acclaimed horror writer <i>Sesuji</i>\u00a0comes an original tale of loss, memory, and fear. Explore, remember, and survive whatever still lingers in the dark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/b76f33c657a3c6107c0d83b8301a7ae6.poster.avif?t=1758008408\" width=650 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/b76f33c657a3c6107c0d83b8301a7ae6.webm?t=1758008408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/b76f33c657a3c6107c0d83b8301a7ae6.mp4?t=1758008408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816890?t=1758008408","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816890?t=1758008408","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/a1e20afc016ad3749edd60f928fbdd1078064502/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758008408","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/a1e20afc016ad3749edd60f928fbdd1078064502/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758008408","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a rundown house tucked away in rural Japan, a lone cat awakens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are that cat, exploring empty rooms and dark halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened to the family that once lived in this place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is the eerie figure stalking you from the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fragments of memories to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run. Search. Escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816890/extras/5a8a061d25752632b2a4a2b77ee8fd26.poster.avif?t=1758008408\" width=650 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it